# PLAY AT POWER-ON: the clock starts and the scene's drones latch; nothing else plays by itself. PRESET
# moves to the next scene, the one before: it glides there (12 s), the drone holding its pedal. HOME's
# knobs are the macros DRONE, VOX, SPACE, TONE. SEQ: it all falls away. Audio in journey.wav.
wav journey.wav
wait 2000
expect playing 1
expect jr_playing 1
expect journey 1
expect scene 1
expect drone1 1
expect vox_notes 0
shot home.png
wait 20000
expect vox_notes 0
turn K1 10
expect macro1 84
turn K2 -5
expect macro2 54
turn PRESET 1
wait 200
expect travelling 1
wait 13000
expect scene 2
expect travelling 0
expect dnote1 33
expect dmoving 0
shot travelled.png
turn PRESET -1
wait 13000
expect scene 1
turn PRESET -1
wait 13000
expect scene 4
expect dnote1 33
turn SELECT 10
wait 100
expect scene 4
shot morph.png
turn SELECT 8
wait 100
expect scene 1
turn SELECT 14
wait 6000
expect scene 1
expect dnote1 33
tap SEQ
wait 200
expect playing 0
expect jr_playing 0
wait 12000
expect drone1 0
wavstop
expect clips 0
expect guardcount 0
